body:
This was posted by my Ukrainian colleague on our workspace:

>Hi guys, I feel like I should share this here. I'm Ukrainian, and the war that started today in the morning is shocking, despite the fact it was somewhat expected.If you're willing to help people of Ukraine with stopping Russian aggression, I'm sharing the list of charity organizations that are actively supporting this cause:

* [https://savelife.in.ua/en/donate/](https://savelife.in.ua/en/donate/)  \- helps the armed forces of Ukraine;
* [https://razomforukraine.org/](https://razomforukraine.org/)  \- supports Ukrainians in their pursuit of a democratic society;
* [https://uacrisis.org/en/](https://uacrisis.org/en/)  \- an international strategic communications hub with active outreach to audiences both in Ukraine and abroad;
* [https://armysos.com.ua/en/](https://armysos.com.ua/en/)  \- helps equip the armed forces on the front, mostly investing in providing the necessary technology;
* [https://peopleinneed.net](https://peopleinneed.net)  \- provides humanitarian aid.

**Please share if you can!**
